@startuml Kode_Voucher
!theme plain
title SD: Voucher & Reward Otomatis
actor Customer
participant "App (Flutter)" as App
participant "Backend" as API
database "Database" as DB

note over App,API: Voucher diambil otomatis saat Checkout dibuka

App -> API: GET /user-vouchers/{uid}
API -> DB: SELECT user_vouchers\nWHERE user_id AND is_used = false
DB --> API: List voucher aktif
API --> App: [{code, discount}]

alt Voucher tersedia
    App -> App: Auto-apply voucher pertama
    App --> Customer: Kode terisi otomatis\n+ potongan tampil di ringkasan
else Tidak ada voucher
    App --> Customer: Field voucher kosong
    Customer -> App: Input kode manual
    App -> App: Cocokkan kode dengan list
    App --> Customer: Potongan diterapkan
end

note over API,DB: Reward otomatis:\nSetiap N transaksi selesai → sistem buat\nvoucher baru di user_vouchers\n(N & nominal dari tabel reward_settings)

@enduml
